body:
Please use a better algorithm for sentiment rating since it misses the point in a lot of reflections.
For example, I wrote in &#34;What lifted you up the most today&#34; that I lost weight, but it was marked as negative in my insights, probably because of &#34;lost&#34;
Also I had one that I wrote &#34;I had a good meal but X person kept bothering me while I ate&#34;. It marked the person as positive
